      {
        "label": "(c)",
        "type": "NUMERICAL",
        "marks": 2,
        "stem": "The sum $\\dfrac{1}{1 \\times 2} + \\dfrac{1}{2 \\times 3} + \\cdots + \\dfrac{1}{n(n + 1)}$ equals $0.95$. Find $n$.",
